///1LIB
Help by Willem Aandewiel
LIB - Manage Digital Research object libraries

///2LISTING
  E>A:LIB MYLIB[M]

Displays module names from MYLIB.REL.
Use [P] to display public symbols as well.

///2CREATING
  E>A:LIB NEWLIB=MODA,MODB

Creates NEWLIB.REL from MODA.REL and MODB.REL.
Choose a new output name if you want to keep an existing library.

///2FORMAT
LIB manages object modules in Microsoft REL format.
The [I] option creates an indexed .IRL library.
A text .LIB file used by MACLIB is a different kind of library.

///2VERSION
This page describes Digital Research LIB-80.
A compiler package may supply another program with the same name
and different syntax. Check its banner and manual if in doubt.
